    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0117" n="107" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg107"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.9311/2–2148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-02-21">February 21,
                        1948</date>.<lb/>[Received February 21—12:31 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>353. Tass communiqué appearing Soviet press today announces extension
                    nonaggression pact USSR and China,<anchor n="58" xml:id="d78-f1"/> points out
                    treaty has been renewed three times since 1937 and that in accordance its
                    provisions treaty will automatically be renewed for additional 2-year period if
                    neither party gives notice of denunciation within 6 months.</p>
                <p>Dept. pass Nanking as 7.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d78-f1" n="58" xml:id="d78-f1-content">
                <p>Signed at Nanking, August 21, League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi
